            "review_title": "Review at Hops & Crust Da Nang",
            "review_text": "bruce a\nDa Nang, Vietnam2 contributions\n0\nGreat location - Great Brews - Changing Menu\nMar 2020\nShowed up here with friends on Day 1 - been a regular since. Off the beaten path a bit, quiet, neighborhood setting. \nEver-changing selection of fine brews and diverse pizza combinations served up by friendly staff. A real gem in Danang!!!!\n\nA relaxing place to stop in for a quick bite or spend the evening sampling great food and the best beers available locally.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 16, 2020",
