            "review_title": "Review at Hops & Crust Da Nang",
            "review_text": "Travelbanana\nDa Nang, Vietnam27 contributions\n0\nOver prises for what you get\nMar 2020 • Friends\nGo a foreign run establishment the service is crap. Waiter could not get our order right had no clue what method of payment they accepted nor checked in and see if we had any other requests. There are many other pizza places in Da Nang, with so much competition and better pricing at the other places Hops and Crust should at least have service to bring them up or justify their existence. But sadly that’s not the case. Won’t be going back there again and surely won’t recommend it\nRead more\nWritten March 4, 2020",
