            "review_text": "DoyvTheShanghaiist\nShanghai, China7 contributions\n0\nGreat vibe. Excellent Pizza, amazing craft beer!!!\nDec 2019 • Friends\nGreat place.\nPizza is excellent and the beer list is probably the biggest I saw in DaNang (99% on tap, I think they have like 20-25 taps or something)...\nService is very effiscient and staff super friendly!\nVietnamese bar manager also knows his stuff when it comes to craft beer!\n100% recommended!\nRead more\nWritten December 20, 2019",
