            "review_text": "RJ_Tran\nDa Nang, Vietnam47 contributions\n0\nAn exciting pizza and craft beer place\nOct 2019\nHops & Crust has some controversy but it is not between the beer and pizza. The truffle pizza with a 100 IBU (amount of hops in the craft) beer is a fantastic combination. There isn't any better, it works. The downside is that this place doesn't seem to use cooling, so if you like sweating, this is the place. I'm not sure who - the target segmentation - is the customer here but what they have in the menu, works wonderfully. Only wish that this place would adopt happy hours like all the other places in the area. If happy hours: 5 stars in TripAdvisor.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten October 27, 2019",
